  "body": "Bumps [react-leaflet](https://github.com/PaulLeCam/react-leaflet) from 4.2.1 to 5.0.0.\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a href=\"https://github.com/PaulLeCam/react-leaflet/releases\">react-leaflet's releases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>v5.0.0</h2>\n<h3>Breaking changes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>React v19 is now required as peer dependency.</li>\n<li>Removed <code>LeafletProvider</code> component from the core package.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>v5.0.0-rc.2</h2>\n<p>This RC uses the stable releases of React v19.</p>\n<h2>v5.0.0-rc.1</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>React v19 is now required as peer dependency.</li>\n<li>Removed <code>LeafletProvider</code> component from the core package.</li>\n</ul>\n</blockquote>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Changelog</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a href=\"https://github.com/PaulLeCam/react-leaflet/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md\">react-leaflet's changelog</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>v5.0.0 (2024-12-14)</h2>\n<h3>Breaking changes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>React v19 is now required as peer dependency.</li>\n<li>Removed <code>LeafletProvider</code> component from the core package.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>v5.0.0-rc.2 (2024-12-06)</h2>\n<p>This RC uses the stable releases of React v19.</p>\n<h2>v5.0.0-rc.1 (2024-05-24)</h2>\n<h3>Breaking changes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>React v19 is now required as peer dependency.</li>\n<li>Removed <code>LeafletProvider</code> component from the core package.</li>\n</ul>\n</blockquote>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/PaulLeCam/react-leaflet/commit/0cf6a84586f836bfc58223e94e5c51e21ed4805f\"><code>0cf6a84</code></a> v5.0.0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/PaulLeCam/react-leaflet/commit/f5b0ef31cd1496b6ed43defb65f29d2875e97a57\"><code>f5b0ef3</code></a> v5.0.0-rc.2</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/PaulLeCam/react-leaflet/commit/93f10658acb18b51c586d49468ab5e3d4db25ed4\"><code>93f1065</code></a> Merge branch 'master' into next</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/PaulLeCam/react-leaflet/commit/3c2888f56eba6015227229cb15ffde2766891663\"><code>3c2888f</code></a> Update React to v19</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/PaulLeCam/react-leaflet/commit/4b71818043fb7308828c17fb927a975833df234c\"><code>4b71818</code></a> fix typo createImageOveraly to createImageOverlay (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/PaulLeCam/react-leaflet/issues/1079\">#1079</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/PaulLeCam/react-leaflet/commit/37164a1c887f69ff691aec046bde5dfcaf7c1710\"><code>37164a1</code></a> v5.0.0-rc.1</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/PaulLeCam/react-leaflet/commit/6d253ed8e60a334082b7a33e9e0d11fa0f5adc04\"><code>6d253ed</code></a> Fix tests</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/PaulLeCam/react-leaflet/commit/214def951effe4a708c16f8e56287b64eed1cbf5\"><code>214def9</code></a> Setup React 19 beta</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/PaulLeCam/react-leaflet/commit/a18438e259be52c6d2b429073363fc0a9d994167\"><code>a18438e</code></a> Use Biome</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/PaulLeCam/react-leaflet/commit/41a04b9683fb3dda0ac08c3b770059cb3ebee811\"><code>41a04b9</code></a> Update dependencies</li>\n<li>See full diff in <a href=\"https://github.com/PaulLeCam/react-leaflet/compare/v4.2.1...v5.0.0\">compare view</a></li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<br />\n\n\n> **Note**\n> Automatic rebases have been disabled on this pull request as it has been open for over 30 days.\n",
